SmartVoIP is a branded deployment overlay for MagnusBilling.

MagnusBilling is copyright MagnusSolution and is distributed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0. See the upstream project:

https://github.com/magnussolution/magnusbilling

This repository's branding, DigitalOcean automation, and documentation
are provided under the same LGPL-3.0 terms so operators can deploy a
white-label billing panel without relicensing the MagnusBilling engine.
